            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An estimated 50% of the population over age 50 years have experienced hemorrhoidal symptoms at some point in their lives. Improved surgical techniques for internal hemorrhoids can reduce postoperative pain and facilitate a quicker recovery.</AbstractText>
